<title>USA: Whitehall Q1 shr $0.20 vs $0.19.</title>
<headline>Whitehall Q1 shr $0.20 vs $0.19.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.20		    $0.19</p>
<p> Net			  1,135		    1,063</p>
<p> Net sales		 13,561		   20,187</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,735		    5,676</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Note: The company said first quarter 1997 sales were lower than first quarter 1996 sales because hangar space was reserved in anticipation of the U.S. Air Force C-130 maintenance contract which wasn't awarded until April. The company also said it experienced in the first quarter of 1996 a rapid expansion of work requiring an unusual increase in the number of contract mechanics which cost more and are less efficient.</p>
</text>
